{
  "id": "verbpraefixe",
  "name": "Prefixes and derivation: des-, re-, pré-, in-, sobre-, contra-, entre- and the hyphen",
  "level": "C1",
  "status": "entwurf",
  "variety": "pt-PT",
  "ptBR": {
    "note": "Same hyphen rules since the 1990 agreement. Pre-agreement texts still show anti-social, contra-regra; today: antissocial, contrarregra."
  },
  "subtitle": "A prefix changes a word's meaning. Des- undoes it: desfazer. Re- repeats it: reabrir. In- denies: inútil. Sobre- goes over: sobrecarregar. Contra- opposes: contradizer. The 1990 agreement settled the hyphen: antissocial, autoestrada, mas pós-graduação, ex-marido, anti-inflamatório.",
  "briefMarks": [
    "des-",
    "re-",
    "in-",
    "pré- / pós-",
    "antissocial",
    "anti-inflamatório"
  ],
  "source": "icanspeak Portuguese original text (grammar-c1 run, 2026-11-13)",
  "concept": {
    "flow": [
      {
        "text": "prefix: des- · re- · in- · sobre- · contra- · entre-",
        "variant": "prep"
      },
      {
        "text": "base word",
        "variant": "verb"
      }
    ],
    "exampleHtml": "<span class=\"vp-prep\">des</span><span class=\"vp-verb\">fazer</span> · <span class=\"vp-prep\">re</span><span class=\"vp-verb\">abrir</span> · <span class=\"vp-prep\">in</span><span class=\"vp-verb\">útil</span> · <span class=\"vp-prep\">sobre</span><span class=\"vp-verb\">carregar</span> · <span class=\"vp-prep\">contra</span><span class=\"vp-verb\">dizer</span> · <span class=\"vp-prep\">anti</span><span class=\"vp-verb\">ssocial</span> · <span class=\"vp-prep\">pós-</span><span class=\"vp-verb\">graduação</span>",
    "qa": [
      {
        "html": "<strong>Des-</strong> undoes or reverses: <em>fazer → desfazer, ligar → desligar, confiar → desconfiar, arrumar → desarrumar</em>. It can mean absence: <em>desemprego, desconto, desculpa</em>. <strong>Re-</strong> repeats or goes back: <em>abrir → reabrir, fazer → refazer, ler → reler, eleger → reeleger</em> (no hyphen).",
        "tag": "des-, re-"
      },
      {
        "html": "<strong>In-</strong> denies (and becomes <em>im-</em> before p and b, <em>il-</em> before l, <em>ir-</em> before r): <em>útil → inútil, possível → impossível, legal → ilegal, regular → irregular, real → irreal</em>. <strong>Pre-</strong> (before), <strong>sobre-</strong> (over), <strong>contra-</strong> (against), <strong>entre-</strong> (between): <em>prever, sobrecarregar, contradizer, entreabrir</em>. A verb with a prefix conjugates like its base: <em>fazer → desfaz, refaz; dizer → contradiz, prevê</em>.",
        "tag": "in-, pre-, sobre-, contra-, entre-"
      },
      {
        "html": "<strong>Hyphen 1 — with some prefixes always.</strong> <em>ex-, vice-, sota-/soto-</em> and the stressed <em>pré-, pós-, pró-</em>: <em>ex-marido, vice-presidente, pré-escolar, pós-graduação, pró-europeu</em>. When the prefix is unstressed and part of the word, no hyphen: <em>prever, promover, pospor</em>.",
        "tag": "Fixed hyphen"
      },
      {
        "html": "<strong>Hyphen 2 — same vowel, or h.</strong> A prefix ending in a vowel + a word starting with <em>the same vowel</em> takes a hyphen: <em>anti-inflamatório, contra-ataque, micro-ondas, auto-observação</em>. Before <em>h</em> too: <em>anti-higiénico, super-homem, sobre-humano</em>. Exceptions: <em>co-</em>, <em>re-</em> and <em>des-</em> (no hyphen: <em>coordenar, reeleger, desumano</em>).",
        "tag": "Same vowel, h"
      },
      {
        "html": "<strong>No hyphen — double r or s.</strong> A prefix ending in a vowel + a word starting with <em>r</em> or <em>s</em>: the consonant doubles: <em>antirreligioso, contrarregra, autossuficiente, antissocial, ultrassom, microssegundo</em>. With a different vowel, simply join: <em>autoestrada, extraescolar, aeroespacial, infraestrutura</em>.",
        "tag": "rr and ss"
      },
      {
        "html": "<strong>Prefix + consonant r.</strong> <em>Hiper-, inter-, super-</em> keep a hyphen before r: <em>inter-racial, hiper-requintado, super-resistente</em>. <em>Circum-</em> and <em>pan-</em> take a hyphen before vowels, h, m, n: <em>circum-navegação, pan-americano</em>. When unsure, look the word up (Ciberdúvidas, Priberam): this area has many exceptions.",
        "tag": "Other cases"
      }
    ],
    "noteHtml": "Common mistakes: ✗ <em>anti-social</em> → ✓ <em>antissocial</em>. ✗ <em>contra-regra</em> → ✓ <em>contrarregra</em>. ✗ <em>auto-estrada</em> → ✓ <em>autoestrada</em> (Portugal, AO90). ✗ <em>re-abrir</em> → ✓ <em>reabrir</em>. ✗ <em>pre-escolar</em> → ✓ <em>pré-escolar</em>. ✗ <em>posgraduação</em> → ✓ <em>pós-graduação</em>. ✗ <em>inlegal</em> → ✓ <em>ilegal</em>.",
